    "Result": "Schools of the future.Bye, Joe.In the future, schools will be different. They will be under the sea, on high mountains and even in space. Robots will help us find books in the library. They will also do other things. In schools, we will use computers in all our lessons. They will help us see dinosaurs and other interesting things. We will have lessons with students from other countries. We will do a lot of things online together. We will not carry books to school. All our books will be on a small computer.",
